	(text "04 Switch control: MCP23S17 (map interfaces.md 7.2) -> 3x DG412 (JFET gates 0 / -15 V), ULN2803A relay sinks. Mixer branch enable = FX_x AND FX_UNMUTE AND MUTE_ALL_N (74LVC1G11). Reset, card absent, ribbon unplugged or -15 V missing: both FX branches shunted (muted), feedback JFETs shunted, relays off. GNDD = DGND island."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
